40
00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:17.711
Malis plants a bean in a pot and waters it. Under the ground, the bean begins to germinate. After a few days, a little sprout comes up. The stem grows taller and taller, and the leaves open. Then a bud appears and opens into a flower with pink petals. Bees carry yellow pollen from flower to flower.

